{"id": "t122-001", "text": "Coffee with Ellie and Mei. Ellie's driving test is Thursday at 10am, third attempt, and she's properly nervous. Mei just got promoted to team lead. Remind me to text Ellie good luck Wednesday night.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ellie", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mei", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ellie", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday at 10am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mei", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "promoted to team lead", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Ellie good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ellie", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday night", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t122-002", "text": "Drinks after work. Noah's housewarming is Saturday 14 June from 7pm, new place in Leith. Aisha's bringing her boyfriend Reza. I'm doing a cheese board. Noah said his sister Joy might come up from Bristol with her new boyfriend, first time any of us will meet him. Party ends at midnight because of the neighbours.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "housewarming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday 14 June from 7pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "place in Leith", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "boyfriend", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reza", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p5", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boyfriend", "owner": "p5"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "midnight", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t122-005", "drop": true, "reason": "incoherent: 'Her brother Elijah' and 'that weekend' have no referent (Lachlan and Colm are the only people, neither female); the second half looks spliced from another memo, so Elijah's owner and the pronouns cannot be labelled consistently"}
{"id": "t122-007", "text": "Sofia's 30th was meant to be a boat party on 21/06 but it's been called off, the boat company went bust. Doing drinks at hers instead. She wants a nice candle, apparently, Jo Malone ones.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "30th", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "21/06", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "drinks at hers", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants a nice candle", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Jo Malone", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t122-008", "text": "Quick one. Dentist Tuesday at 9:15, then picking up the dry cleaning.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Dentist", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday at 9:15", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "then", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "picking up the dry cleaning", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t122-013", "text": "Dinner at Omar and Yetunde's last night. They're doing a joint 40th on 18 May, garden do, kids welcome. Omar's started a pottery class and won't shut up about it. Yetunde's mum is staying with them for the summer. Dr Banerjee also wants a site visit on 18/11 at 10am. Rafael asked if I could join, I said yes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Omar", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yetunde", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last night"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "joint 40th", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "18 May", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Omar", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "pottery class", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yetunde", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying with them", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the summer", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dr Banerjee", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "site visit", "owner": "p5", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "18/11 at 10am", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rafael", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t122-014", "text": "Work drinks. Rafael said Dr Banerjee from the client is impossible, rejected the third draft. Rafael's presenting to their board Monday at 11. He's stressed. I should check in with him Monday afternoon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rafael", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dr Banerjee", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "client", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rafael", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "presenting to their board", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday at 11", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t122-018", "text": "Simone and Duc are doing a housewarming on the 9th of August. Duc said bring nothing, Simone said bring wine. They've got a new kitten called Pickle. Simone's still waiting on her MA results, due end of the month. Simone's mum is flying in from Lyon for it and staying a fortnight, which Duc is pretending to be happy about.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Simone", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "housewarming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 9th of August", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Simone", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "new kitten called Pickle", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Simone", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "MA results", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of the month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Simone", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from Lyon", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a fortnight", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretending to be happy", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t122-021", "text": "Elijah from accounts mentioned his dad's retiring after 35 years at the post office. Party's at the rugby club on 26/09, evening. Elijah's organising a slideshow and wants old photos.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elijah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "accounts", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring after 35 years at the post office", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "26/09, evening", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elijah", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t122-024", "text": "Team meeting ran long. Our manager Graham announced the restructure consultation starts 1 November. Noah's role is at risk, he's worried about the mortgage. Hugo seems fine. Should take Noah for a coffee next week. Hugo thinks the consultation will drag on till February. Ava from HR is running the one-to-ones, first ones on 3 November at 9am.", "spans": [{"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "restructure consultation", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "1 November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "role is at risk", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried about the mortgage", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hugo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take Noah for a coffee", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hugo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "till February", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ava", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "HR", "owner": "p6", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "one-to-ones", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "3 November at 9am", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t122-026", "text": "Aisha said her little girl has her first ballet show on Saturday morning at 10:30. Aisha's husband can't go, he's working, so she's taking her mum. Remember to ask Aisha on Monday how the show went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "little girl", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first ballet show", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday morning at 10:30", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Aisha on Monday how the show went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t122-027", "text": "Omar's grandad passed away on Sunday. Funeral is Friday 3rd at 1pm in Bradford. Omar's taking the week off. I need to send flowers to the family and sort cover for his clients.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Omar", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday 3rd at 1pm", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Omar", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking the week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send flowers to the family", "owner": "r2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort cover for his clients", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t122-028", "text": "Long call with Elena Novak. She's sitting the Life in the UK test on 22 May at 11am. Also she's applying for a new role at the hospital, interview's the week after. Her husband Petr thinks she's overdoing it. She's coeliac, remember for the dinner.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elena Novak", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Life in the UK test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "22 May at 11am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Petr", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "coeliac", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t122-029", "text": "Colm's band have a gig at the Brudenell on 4 October, doors at 8. Lachlan and I are going. Colm's on bass, the drummer is his cousin.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Colm", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gig at the Brudenell", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "4 October", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "8", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lachlan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Colm", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bass", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousin", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t122-031", "text": "Helen's anniversary dinner, 25 years, is at the Ivy on 30 June. She's invited six of us. I'm doing the toast, apparently. Must write something before the 20th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Helen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "anniversary dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "30 June", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "write something", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the 20th", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t122-032", "text": "Giulia's dissertation hand-in is Friday at 4pm. She's been in the library till midnight all week. Her flatmate Adriana is bringing her food. Text Giulia Saturday morning to see how she's feeling. Reza says the team is mostly in Dublin so he'll be flying out on the 20th for a week of onboarding.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dissertation hand-in", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 4pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "till midnight all week"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "flatmate", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adriana", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text Giulia", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reza", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p4", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 20th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t122-033", "text": "Reza is starting at Google on Monday. Very excited, slightly intimidated. His partner Yetunde says he's already bought three new shirts. Remind me to message Reza Monday night and ask how the first day went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reza", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starting at Google", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "slightly intimidated", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yetunde", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message Reza Monday night and ask how the first day went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reza", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday night", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t122-034", "text": "Haircut Saturday 11am. Then try and get to the garden centre before it shuts.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Haircut", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday 11am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Then", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get to the garden centre", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before it shuts", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t122-036", "text": "Simone texted, her MA results came through. Distinction! Party at theirs Saturday evening to celebrate. Duc's doing a barbecue, weather permitting.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Simone", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "MA results", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Party at theirs", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday evening", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t122-037", "text": "Hugo's leaving drinks were meant to be tonight but got called off, half the team has covid. Rescheduled to next Thursday at 5:30. Hugo's off to Lisbon for a month after he finishes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hugo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Thursday at 5:30", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hugo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Lisbon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "after he finishes", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t122-038", "text": "Catch-up call with Ryan. His mum had her knee op on Tuesday, recovery is slow and she's frustrated. Ryan is driving up to Leeds every weekend. His sister Leah is helping in the week. I should ring Ryan's mum myself, she'd like that. Also Ryan's birthday is 17 March, he's been dropping hints about a coffee grinder.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee op", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "frustrated", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving up to Leeds", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every weekend", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leah", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the week"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring Ryan's mum", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ryan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "17 March", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "dropping hints about a coffee grinder", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t122-039", "text": "Aditi said her driving instructor cancelled again, so the test on the 5th might move. She's fed up. Her brother Noah offered to take her out in his car on Sunday morning.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "driving instructor", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 5th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fed up", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "take her out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday morning", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t122-050", "text": "Tomás got his audition result. Into the National Youth Theatre! Rehearsals start in January in London. He's moving in with his aunt. Remember to congratulate him properly when I see him Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tomás", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "audition result", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Into the National Youth Theatre", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Rehearsals", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving in", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "aunt", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "congratulate him properly", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "when I see him Saturday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t122-052", "text": "Talked to Duc Nakamura after the client call. Client wants everything by 31/10, which is mad. Duc's going on paternity leave on the 3rd of November, baby due early November. He's worried about handing over. Should offer to take the Henderson account off him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc Nakamura", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the client call"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by 31/10"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "paternity leave", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd of November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "early November", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried about handing over", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to take the Henderson account off him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t122-056", "text": "Elijah and Aisha had lunch with me. Elijah's wife is pregnant with their second, due in April. Aisha is training for a half marathon on 12 April. Elijah wants to start running too but has a bad knee. Aisha suggested a couch to 5k thing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elijah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elijah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in April", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "half marathon", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "12 April", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elijah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to start running", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "bad knee", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t122-058", "text": "Long chat with Helen over lunch. She's applying for the head of department role, interview on 4 December at 2:30pm, and she's a nervous wreck. Her husband Graham thinks she's a shoo-in. If she gets it, she starts after Easter. Her mum's 80th is the weekend before the interview, so it's a busy few weeks. Remind me to ask Helen how the interview went and to get a card for her mum.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Helen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "4 December at 2:30pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous wreck", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after Easter", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "80th", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend before the interview", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Helen how the interview went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Helen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a card for her mum", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}]}
